    "Would adding toast resolve the uncertainty? Toast does seem unusually confident.",
    "Maybe the real issue is texture. No, now I'm ranking crunchiness.",
]
# Each request from 3 through 15 gets its own remark, without repetition in a streak.
REROLL_REMARKS = [
    "Third suggestion. Your stomach has filed a complaint.",
    "You're browsing dinner like it has customer reviews.",
    "Five options. One dinner. You can do this.",
    "Your fridge is starting to take this personally.",
    "Somewhere, a perfectly good meal is being ignored.",
    "We've now spent longer choosing than some meals take to cook.",
    "You have enough options to open a very confused restaurant.",
    "Ten suggestions. Your dinner now has a shortlist and a sequel.",
    "At this point, indecision is the main course.",
